text:
It is time to repot my Codiaeum and I read one article that said to use soil with peat, a different article that said to use a soil *without* peat, and I just don't know who to believe! What do y'all think?

&#x200B;

Additionally, any tips on repotting this plant in general? I've had it for just over a year and it's grown impressively, only just thought to check the bottom to see its little roots poking out- whoops! Want to make sure it continues to thrive
